{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447070-complications-for-a-bella-swan-assassination-storyline","id":1447070,"title":"Complications for a Bella Swan assassination storyline","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-02T18:26:02-07:00","id":1447070,"title":"Complications for a Bella Swan assassination storyline","content":"I'm about to run a Sabbat game, and I'm going to create a storyline that includes them assassinating the Bella Swans(the Sabbat slang for human touchstones in my universe) of Cammies to drive them closer to wighthood.<br /> <br /> Now, the first couple of missions will likely be pure power-fantasy: just crashing through windows and kicking down doors and visiting horrible cruelty and death upon a Bella Swan and reveling in the sheer glorious giddy joy of it.<br /> <br /> However, I want doing this to gradually become more difficult. So I would like some brainstorming on how to make Bella Swan assassination missions more complicated. Thank you in advance for the brainstorming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","user":"CajunKhan","date":". 05-02-2021, 09:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T18:35:11-07:00","id":1447073,"title":"","content":"Instead of being a dorky High School girl, they find out that the woman they're assassinating is a 70 year old, 20 year old body ghoul that has stuffed her house full of machine guns and grenades.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Alt: Mage<br /> <br /> They'll still get her but it'd be a hilarious twist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T18:39:53-07:00","id":1447074,"title":"","content":"the potential for puns is just too good.<br /> &quot;Hell's Bells&quot;<br /> &quot;Swan Lake,it ain't&quot;<br /> &quot;Twiligrenade!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T19:57:08-07:00","id":1447091,"title":"","content":"Bella Swans really should be a high-priority target for Sabbat. Think of the possible results:<br /> <br /> (1)The Cammy elder becomes a wight, and likely gets destroyed by his own allies. Maybe takes down an ally or two before falling. That's a lot of destruction gained just by eating some juicebag.<br /> <br /> (2)The Cammy elder doesn't become a wight, but he moves close enough to wighthood that he becomes desperate for a solution, a solution the Sabbat are happy to provide.<br /> <br /> (3)The Cammy elder moves a little closer to becoming a wight, but not close enough to produce a panic. Instead, he just becomes a bigger asshole to the young Cammies. The young Cammies become desperate for a way out from under the thumb of this increasingly tyrannical elder, a way out the Sabbat is happy to provide for these youngsters. <br /> <br /> Any one of those results is a huge win, and all for the low low price of snuffing a swan who is far more fragile and will generally have far less security than a Cammy elder. Bella Swans are a huge Achilles Heel just waiting to be ripped out by the right pair of fangs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T20:04:51-07:00","id":1447092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447070-complications-for-a-bella-swan-assassination-storyline?p=1447091#post1447091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bella Swans really should be a high-priority target for Sabbat. Think of the possible results:<br /> <br /> (1)The Cammy elder becomes a wight, and likely gets destroyed by his own allies. Maybe takes down an ally or two before falling. That's a lot of destruction gained just by eating some juicebag.<br /> <br /> (2)The Cammy elder doesn't become a wight, but he moves close enough to wighthood that he becomes desperate for a solution, a solution the Sabbat are happy to provide.<br /> <br /> (3)The Cammy elder moves a little closer to becoming a wight, but not close enough to produce a panic. Instead, he just becomes a bigger asshole to the young Cammies. The young Cammies become desperate for a way out from under the thumb of this increasingly tyrannical elder, a way out the Sabbat is happy to provide for these youngsters.<br /> <br /> Any one of those results is a huge win, and all for the low low price of snuffing a swan who is far more fragile and will generally have far less security than a Cammy elder. Bella Swans are a huge Achilles Heel just waiting to be ripped out by the right pair of fangs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironically, I imagine this results in a net loss for the Sabbat as a strategic element, though.<br /> <br /> The Sabbat are symbolically striking at the Humanity of the vampires and it fits their ideology. HOWEVER, what it actually does is taking down a Touchstone is also one of the few things that will make vampires STAY AND FIGHT or use their influence versus leaving or leaving the battle to others.<br /> <br /> One thing I liked about the Clan Novels is that the Camarilla was in a state of constant strategic retreat because they didn't give a shit about the humans or the Camarilla as a whole. The only people fighting were the Anarchs to the point that they used Mass Embraces like the Sabbat and paid assassins.<br /> <br /> I can see this strategy as the one way to really unite Camarilla vampires to make the battle one the Sabbat would regret.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 05-03-2021, 12:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T21:38:56-07:00","id":1447103,"title":"","content":"I agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a>. The most probable reaction for any elder who loses their Touchstone is going to be investigating who did it to exact terrible vengeance upon them. Most elders who've lasted long enough to become elders are pretty smart. If they run into trouble during the investigation, they usually have a lot of prestation they can call in (or valuable prestation they can promise) to other vampires in return for assistance. Since the Touchstone is already dead, they have much less reason to be antsy about revealing the Touchstone's existence to other vampires.<br /> <br /> Any elder who becomes a wight from losing their Touchstone was probably already on the brink of wassail to begin with. Maybe that'll happen, but it might not. Being a bigger asshole to neonates might happen, but it also might not. The elder might become obsessed with finding their Touchstone's murderers to the exclusion of all other activities. The elder might fall into torpor from ennui. The elder might withdraw from Elysium and stop socializing with their usual associates. People react to loss in different ways. Some of these reactions may benefit the Sabbat, but without serious psychological study of a target, it's hard to know exactly how an elder will respond--beyond that it's probably a safe bet they will want revenge on whoever did this terrible thing.<br /> <br /> If a Sabbat pack really wants to use an elder's Touchstones to fuck with them, frame another Camarilla elder for the deed. Or kidnap the Touchstone and use them as a hostage. Mail fingers if the elder doesn't take actions which make the Sabbat's takeover of the city easier. Maybe frame another Camarilla elder as the kidnapper, too, to be extra safe. Just killing the Touchstone is a gamble, not a plan.<br /> <br /> Of course, maybe the pack doesn't have a plan. Maybe they're just young and dumb and want to kill an elder's favorite mortals as a giant &quot;Fuck You!&quot; to the Camarilla. That's eminently in-keeping with the Sabbat's reputation as a bunch of murderous hooligans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T21:45:42-07:00","id":1447104,"title":"","content":"I like the confession of Pagan Min from <b>FAR CRY 4</b>. Basically, that he was, in part, glad when he lost his lover who he cared about more than anything because it allowed him to release all of the horrible evil he'd been repressing in her names.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't be surprised if something similar happens.<br /> <br /> Which might benefit the Sabbat in its own way.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T02:23:43-07:00","id":1447134,"title":"","content":"It'd be hard to work out who are touchstones and why. You'd be better off going straight for the vampire. Killing the swans would be too wasteful for the effort you go through. It'd be better to take some swans as hostages and have the vampire work against the cam for their return (You should of course, return the swan unharmed, because the strat won't work again if you go back on your word)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T08:47:46-07:00","id":1447205,"title":"","content":"As for a complication, how about the Sabbat group is set up to hit the wrong target. Rather than hitting a group of mortals at barn dance or something, they hit a group of mortal hunters who are armed, armored and about to go out on a hunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T16:25:32-07:00","id":1447297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447070-complications-for-a-bella-swan-assassination-storyline?p=1447205#post1447205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for a complication, how about the Sabbat group is set up to hit the wrong target. Rather than hitting a group of mortals at barn dance or something, they hit a group of mortal hunters who are armed, armored and about to go out on a hunt.</div> </div> </div> </div>Y'know, when I first read your idea I dismissed it as too improbable. But it just hit me I could work in the desertion of SOME Lasombra with it. (The total desertion of the clan simply isn't going to be a thing in my game) The characters are on a routine swan-snuffing mission when they end up walking face-first into a bunch of hunters. This leads into the mystery of why they got such bad intel, which ultimately leads to a group of traitor Lasombra.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T22:54:58-07:00","id":1447352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447070-complications-for-a-bella-swan-assassination-storyline?p=1447297#post1447297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Y'know, when I first read your idea I dismissed it as too improbable. But it just hit me I could work in the desertion of SOME Lasombra with it. (The total desertion of the clan simply isn't going to be a thing in my game) The characters are on a routine swan-snuffing mission when they end up walking face-first into a bunch of hunters. This leads into the mystery of why they got such bad intel, which ultimately leads to a group of traitor Lasombra.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or have an elders touchstone be a prepper or militia member, or a straight up terrorist, with all the firepower and associates that implies, it doesn't have to be hunters to be dangerous, a .50 BMG AP incendiary shot at you by nutter is just as catastrophic as one shot by a well trained hunter","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T23:47:35-07:00","id":1447362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1447070-complications-for-a-bella-swan-assassination-storyline?p=1447297#post1447297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Y'know, when I first read your idea I dismissed it as too improbable. But it just hit me I could work in the desertion of SOME Lasombra with it. (The total desertion of the clan simply isn't going to be a thing in my game) The characters are on a routine swan-snuffing mission when they end up walking face-first into a bunch of hunters. This leads into the mystery of why they got such bad intel, which ultimately leads to a group of traitor Lasombra.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, it was only 50% of the Clan in OPP not the entire Clan and it was because the leadership discovered that, no, Lasombra the Antediluvian is alive.<br /> <br /> They sided with the Anarchs/Sabbat because according their culture, you keep what you kill.<br /> <br /> Gratiano was Clan Leader only because he killed his Boss. If he didn't then the Clan should never have joined the Anarchs in the first place.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\